WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:03.797
Roxy heard someone crying.

2
00:00:03.798 --> 00:00:08.404
Using her x-ray vision, she peered through the walls of the house.

3
00:00:08.405 --> 00:00:13.265
In a dark room, down a long hallway, Roxy saw two figures.

4
00:00:13.266 --> 00:00:15.790
One man, dressed like a monk, was crying.

5
00:00:15.791 --> 00:00:18.397
The other figure looked like a purple monster.

6
00:00:18.398 --> 00:00:21.474
Ropes bound their arms and legs.

7
00:00:21.475 --> 00:00:24.573
"This is awful, Wujing," the monk said.

8
00:00:24.574 --> 00:00:28.406
"We'll never reach the Western Paradise now!"

9
00:00:28.407 --> 00:00:32.690
"I'm sorry, Master," Wujing said.

10
00:00:32.691 --> 00:00:36.318
"When I checked the horse, demons attacked me.

11
00:00:36.319 --> 00:00:40.261
There were so many—I couldn't fight them all."

12
00:00:40.262 --> 00:00:48.619
The monk cried some more. "And soon we'll be . . . eaten!"

13
00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:51.424
"Oh no!" Roxy blurted out.

14
00:00:51.425 --> 00:00:55.405
"The squire has prisoners—and someone is going to eat them."

15
00:00:55.406 --> 00:01:01.884
The squire walked back into the room. "That's right!"

16
00:01:01.885 --> 00:01:07.132
Suddenly the beautiful room turned into a gloomy cave.

17
00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:10.931
The squire grew ugly with sharp fangs and horns.

18
00:01:10.932 --> 00:01:16.283
"You're a demon!" Roxy gasped.

19
00:01:16.284 --> 00:01:20.060
*** Wukong, in the form of a car, zoomed down the

20
00:01:20.061 --> 00:01:23.691
street. He tried to catch up to the bank robbers, Dwight and

21
00:01:23.692 --> 00:01:28.035
Earl. Wukong skidded around a corner and nearly hit another

22
00:01:28.036 --> 00:01:33.271
car. The driver waved his fist. "Watch where you're going, you crazy

23
00:01:33.272 --> 00:01:37.715
driver!" "Sorry!" Wukong

24
00:01:37.716 --> 00:01:42.619
shouted. The robbers drove out of the city and down a long

25
00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:46.726
road. Finally they stopped near a large

26
00:01:46.727 --> 00:01:51.814
building. Wukong transformed back into himself and

27
00:01:51.815 --> 00:01:57.676
hid. The robbers got out of their car and gazed

28
00:01:57.677 --> 00:02:01.391
around. "I'm glad we escaped that awful monkey," Dwight

29
00:02:01.392 --> 00:02:07.412
said. "That monkey didn't scare me," Earl said with a

30
00:02:07.413 --> 00:02:13.000
snort. "What?" Dwight shook his head. "You screamed and ran, just like I did!"

31
00:02:13.001 --> 00:02:17.294
"I thought the monkey was really scary!" a voice said.

32
00:02:17.295 --> 00:02:21.063
Dwight looked around. "Who said that?"

33
00:02:21.064 --> 00:02:27.477
A squirrel walked calmly along a fence. "I did."

34
00:02:27.478 --> 00:02:32.518
"Do you hear that, Dwight?" Earl said. "It's a talking squirrel!"

35
00:02:32.519 --> 00:02:35.734
"First we saw a talking monkey," Dwight said.

36
00:02:35.735 --> 00:02:41.672
"Now we see a talking squirrel . . . What in the world is going on?"

37
00:02:41.673 --> 00:02:46.326
The squirrel sat on its hind legs and quickly changed shape.

38
00:02:46.327 --> 00:02:49.876
"It's the monkey!" Dwight and Earl yelled.

39
00:02:49.877 --> 00:02:53.326
"Yes, it's me," Wukong said with a grin.

40
00:02:53.327 --> 00:02:56.765
"And you two fools are under arrest!"

41
00:02:56.766 --> 00:03:00.273
The men tried to flee, but Wukong jumped in front of them.

42
00:03:00.274 --> 00:03:05.193
He grabbed each man by the arm and yelled, "You're coming with me!"

43
00:03:05.194 --> 00:03:13.466
Still holding the men, Wukong leaped into the air and hopped onto a cloud. Whoosh!

44
00:03:13.467 --> 00:03:17.491
"Whoa, Dwight, we're flying!" Earl said.

45
00:03:17.492 --> 00:03:22.007
Dwight squeezed his eyes shut and didn't answer.

46
00:03:22.008 --> 00:03:27.401
Back in Metro City, Wukong returned to True Savings Bank and found Detective Smith.

47
00:03:27.402 --> 00:03:30.774
"Here you go, Detective!" Wukong said with a grin.

48
00:03:30.775 --> 00:03:35.085
"I caught the robbers, and I didn't smash them to pieces!"

49
00:03:35.086 --> 00:03:41.150
"Nice work, Wukong," Detective Smith said, looking pleased.

50
00:03:41.151 --> 00:03:45.114
Detective Smith and Wukong took Dwight and Earl to Metro City Jail.

51
00:03:45.115 --> 00:03:49.740
Wukong looked around. "Do you have many villains in this jail?"

52
00:03:49.741 --> 00:03:53.532
Detective Smith shrugged. "Not too many."

53
00:03:53.533 --> 00:03:55.843
Wukong heard someone snoring.

54
00:03:55.844 --> 00:04:00.793
"Is that . . . ?" His words trailed off as he listened carefully.

55
00:04:00.794 --> 00:04:03.845
Zzz-zz!

56
00:04:03.846 --> 00:04:07.555
"I recognize that snore!" Wukong said.

57
00:04:07.556 --> 00:04:12.348
He ran over to a cell where a large pig was fast asleep.

58
00:04:12.349 --> 00:04:19.214
Wukong laughed. "I've found Bajie!"

